* The harmonic sum up to W is at most K / phi ( K ) times the harmonic sum over the integers up to W coprime to K (V3's cophrm chain: the smooth/coprime split cof1, sumprodub, smsum, phipfprod), before its log W step; Detection.lean's P1_lower_log reads it at W = |_ R.

